Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the snow mountain training has ended safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great work, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After one drink, we're outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've heard the rumors about Kyoya-senpai too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That ideia is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs29\pos(193.6,109.867)}Onimomomomo{\b0\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,257.067)}{\fs29\b1}EP 26
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, it's Neko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightweight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They were super exhausted, \Nso the alcohol hit them fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them were running all over \Nthe snow mountain playing disruptors, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,plus a certain demon teacher \Nmade them do extra training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so, I've already arranged it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaasu~!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! A drink with fellow classmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I heard Masu was coming to Rasetsu, \NI was like, "we gotta have a drink!" 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, cheers to our class!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unusual for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dumped with some chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we drank together, Masu~. \NI'm so happy!💋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean! Whatever, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey hey, Innami-kun and Nekosaki-kun... 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what kind of kisses do you like?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've secured Hagure and Innami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. \NThere's a high chance Kyoya will be summoned too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Momotaro movement is becoming active.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like things are gonna get troublesome again.
